{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Draft an advert"},"description":"Start a Boatsite advert for the signed-in user as a draft; it never publishes. The first call, without draftId, saves the draft and returns a link for the user to open on their phone, where they add at least 3 photos, check the advert and tap Publish themselves. Call again with draftId for where it has got to: a fresh link while it waits for photos or the user's tap, or the advert's link once they have published it. Needs the user to connect their Boatsite account.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"attributes":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Facts about the boat, as the seller gave them. Only those that apply to its section are accepted.","properties":{"anodes_replaced":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"beam_ft":{"maximum":30,"minimum":1,"type":"number"},"berths":{"maximum":20,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"bss_expiry":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"craft_type":{"enum":["narrowboat","widebeam","dutch_barge"],"type":"string"},"engine_cc":{"maximum":3000,"minimum":50,"type":"integer"},"engine_hours":{"maximum":100000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"engine_hp":{"maximum":5000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"engine_make":{"maxLength":40,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"engine_stroke":{"enum":["two_stroke","four_stroke"],"type":"string"},"engine_type":{"enum":["inboard","outboard","sterndrive","jet","electric","none"],"type":"string"},"fuel":{"enum":["petrol","diesel","electric","hybrid","none"],"type":"string"},"heating":{"enum":["stove","diesel_central_heating","gas_central_heating","none"],"type":"string"},"hull_material":{"enum":["grp","steel","aluminium","wood","plastic","inflatable","composite","other"],"type":"string"},"hull_survey_type":{"enum":["out_of_water","ultrasonic","in_water"],"type":"string"},"inflatable":{"type":"boolean"},"keel_t